{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of tiny, crazy insects created and commanded by a delightfully cruel entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 4 friends and explore space crops to collect adorable creatures\u2026 and extract their energy for your <i>master</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/1dc7053e3d2d7bf6c3c4b3693f0eff77.poster.avif?t=1762898893\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/1dc7053e3d2d7bf6c3c4b3693f0eff77.webm?t=1762898893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/1dc7053e3d2d7bf6c3c4b3693f0eff77.mp4?t=1762898893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><strong>Dig</strong>, gather, and dash across strange alien landscapes while avoiding traps, hostile creatures, and your <i>creator's</i> relentless critiques.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/134b482db394e0c3b013e1ea5f1b1d4f.poster.avif?t=1762898893\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/134b482db394e0c3b013e1ea5f1b1d4f.webm?t=1762898893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong>, sacrifice little living beings, transport bizarre alien artifacts, and coordinate to meet <strong>quotas</strong> without leaving anything behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/ba84e7ad137db2f496dd1fa1c42e3703.poster.avif?t=1762898893\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/ba84e7ad137db2f496dd1fa1c42e3703.webm?t=1762898893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/extras/ba84e7ad137db2f496dd1fa1c42e3703.mp4?t=1762898893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong>, <strong>survive</strong>... and endure the demands of a <i>master</i> who is impossible to please. Use the resources you gather to unlock new tools, gadgets, and skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <i>creator</i> watches, criticizes, and revels in your failures\u2026 and absolutely loves it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135040?t=1762898893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/f88f870a51af7dab8fb5d35d5631ff0b0e7f8973/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762898893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/bcafc32365a51a588b10bcc2279d396a73f3caf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762898893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135040/bcafc32365a51a588b10bcc2279d396a73f3caf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762898893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller s